# Scoped to the web image build (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore for this Dockerfile only).
# Keeps the build context to web/ + deploy/web-nginx.conf and drops everything heavy/irrelevant.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.git/
**/TestResults/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
src/
docs/
design_handoff_emaigrator/
